    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Streaming Insights & Incident Diagnosis",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Real-Time Telemetry Insights\n\n- **Paced Ingestion Health:** Continuous multi-batch stream simulator pumps 100 packets/sec with dynamic arrival timestamps.\n\n- **Highest Risk Channel:** `mqtt/pharma/shipment/environment`  \n  *Insight:* Transit reefer containers show 2.4x higher variance in thermal bounds during multi-modal freight handoffs.\n\n- **Dead-Letter / Quarantine Stream:** `stg.rejected_records`  \n  *Status:* Empty SensorReadingID or out-of-range temperatures (-40\u00b0C to +90\u00b0C) automatically intercepted.\n\n- **Recommended Protocol:**  \n  Automated webhook dispatches SMS alert to warehouse shift supervisor when 3 consecutive readings breach 8.0\u00b0C in Cold Zone."
      }
    },
